<title>USA: Centigram CEO George Sollman resigns.</title>
<headline>Centigram CEO George Sollman resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centigram Communications Corp said Wednesday that George Sollman, its president and chief executive officer, had resigned.</p>
<p>Sollman will stay acting CEO until April 15, or later, if requested by the board, and remains a director of the company.</p>
<p>Centigram said its board will immediately begin a search for a new CEO.</p>
<p>Centigram provides wireless and wireline messaging and communications solutions.</p>
